TPR.HUB — Telegram knowledge corpus for TelePrompTR

role    = research + reference + harness patterns
scope   = Telegram Bot API, agent patterns, training suite, harness templates
feeds   = TelePromptR (relay station), harness product line

API/
  RichMessages.ref   — sendRichMessage, sendRichMessageDraft, all 21 block types,
                       24 RichText types, InputRichMessage, ephemeral messaging
  Streaming.ref      — sendMessageDraft + sendRichMessageDraft, 30s TTL behavior,
                       implementation patterns for text + rich agent streaming
  Threads.ref        — Forum topics, createForumTopic, thread = session pattern,
                       Community type, DirectMessagesTopic
  Changelog.ref      — Bot API 10.1 + 10.2 (June-July 2026), full diff

BotFather/
  Menu.ref           — every BotFather page logged: what it sets, the API
                       method that does it headless, which file in a ZenBot
                       pack holds it, and the doc link

Bots/
  bots.kdl           — the registry. One node per bot: being, vault KEY NAME,
                       pack, seat env, switches, spend. The token is NEVER
                       here; `id` is the token's public prefix, so a swapped
                       token shows up without anything reading the secret

bin/
  new-zenbot         — scaffold a bot: pack from ZenBots/.template, register
                       it, print the BotFather steps in order. Writes no
                       prose and invents no token — voice and secrets are
                       Lucius's

Docs.ref             — the Telegram doc index, every URL verified 200

status  = seeded (2026-08-10) · bot registry + BotFather log (⧗-26.392)
note    = Telegram has NO llms.txt or AI-friendly docs. This hub IS that.
note    = NOT !CLOUD. _SRV/WHOAMI: instances are !CLOUD/<NAME>/ with
          <NAME>.me · policy.kdl · ledger.gensL, and that family is
          storage/infra guarded by srv-snap. A bot registry is station
          config, so the hub sits beside the station it serves.

